  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bridging traditional governance and rule of law through youths&#x2019; participation as  agents of peace and change in Rennel and Bellona project.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is implemented jointly between UNDP and World Vision International with the core objective that young women and young men are empowered as agent of change and allow them build local peace and dialogue and facilitate inter and intra-generational transmission of knowledge. The project will also ensure that youth as land owners participate in the decision-making process on the management of land and natural resources. The focus on youths as agents of change will help bridging the gap be</narrative>
  </description>
